WEBVTT

00:00:00.104 --> 00:00:05.732
Build a question paper

00:00:05.782 --> 00:00:09.396
Open Content Creation, then Paper Builder.

00:00:11.457 --> 00:00:18.190
Choose the class and subject, then finish the title. It starts from the class and subject.

00:00:27.505 --> 00:00:37.338
Go to Paper Structure. Sections are optional. A marks warning appears, so press Continue, then choose Type manually.

00:00:44.125 --> 00:00:47.489
Type the question, then add it to the paper.

00:00:56.186 --> 00:01:01.655
Open the draft to save it. Your papers are listed under Question Papers.

00:01:04.757 --> 00:01:07.256
The paper is saved as a draft.

00:01:10.716 --> 00:01:15.386
Paper saved
